HARNESS NOTE: orders placed AFTER ~order 91858 render 500 on admin.order.details on BOTH servers (e.g. 91880). Cause = my harness, not the ticket: every Items bulk-update round trip re-escaped the item description (backslashes doubled), so order_details.item_details (TEXT, 65535) is TRUNCATED -> json null -> blade `$detail->item['id']` offset-on-null. Orders 91809-91812 (item_details ~4990 bytes) render fine. 128 order_details rows hit the 65535 cap in the private DB.
